{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong>Myth of Empires: Xizhou Civilization Pack</strong> will be available on <strong>March 20</strong>! Pre-order now and enjoy a <strong>10% discount</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A New Era Begins \u2013 Shah Civilization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world of Myth of Empires expands once more with the arrival of the <strong>Shah Civilization</strong>\u2014a land of thriving trade, fearless cavalry, and rich cultural heritage. Known for its mastery of both agriculture and animal husbandry, the people of Xizhou have shaped history with their unparalleled craftsmanship and military prowess. Explore this dynamic new civilization, uncover hidden secrets, and take on new challenges!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Xizhou Civilization Pack includes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Xizhou Map:</strong> A breathtaking landscape where vast deserts meet lush oases, creating a unique ecological setting. Hidden within the region are <strong>mysterious cave dungeons</strong> filled with deadly bosses and valuable rewards, enticing high-level players to test their skills.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Imperial Fall Device:</strong> A multi-functional structure integrating <strong>power generation, mining, teleportation, storage, </strong>and<strong> automated manufacturing</strong>, streamlining production like never before.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>4 Unique Vehicles:</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Desert Ship \u2013 A large land-based mobile platform for traversing harsh terrains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigator \u2013 A massive waterborne vehicle for crossing vast bodies of water.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mechanized Woodcutter \u2013 A two-person operated harvester designed for efficient resource collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mechanized Horse \u2013 An autonomous transport vehicle for effortless navigation.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>9 New Armor Sets:</strong> 3 Light Armor sets &amp; 6 Heavy Armor sets.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>16 Powerful Weapons:</strong> 13 melee weapons &amp; 3 firearms to diversify combat strategies.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>2 Fine Animal Saddles:</strong> Camel Saddle and Ostrich Saddle for unique mounts.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Imperial Fall Structure Recipes:</strong> Unlock blueprints for exclusive architectural designs</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Construction Bench:</strong> Imperial Fall Crafting Bench</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>New Consumable:</strong> Endurance Pill</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>3 Rare Smelting Materials:</strong> Aqua Jade Ingot, Boiling Silver Ingot, Immortal Molt Ingot</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After the Xizhou Civilization Pack version is launched, open &quot;Silk Road Atlas&quot; to track quest objectives, dungeon locations, and boss coordinates. Completing tasks will unlock related recipes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Additionally, this update introduces a range of <strong>new gameplay mechanics</strong> available to all players, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Profession Change System</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Crop Expertise</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Martial Scripture Scrolls</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Horse Grooming</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Autonomous Warrior Hiring</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Zip-line Construction</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare to embark on an <strong>epic new chapter of exploration, conquest, and innovation</strong>!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3502710?t=1740680761","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3502710?t=1740680761","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502710/2311e4f39445080bb2c68cf0baf689de187565ef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740680761","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3502710/2311e4f39445080bb2c68cf0baf689de187565ef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740680761","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"LAN PvP","id":47},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"LAN Co-op","id":48},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"HDR available","id":61}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The <strong>Myth of Empires: Xizhou Civilization Pack</strong> will be available on <strong>March 20</strong>! Pre-order now and enjoy a <strong>10% discount</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A New Era Begins \u2013 Shah Civilization</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The world of Myth of Empires expands once more with the arrival of the <strong>Shah Civilization</strong>\u2014a land of thriving trade, fearless cavalry, and rich cultural heritage. Known for its mastery of both agriculture 