r unique mounts.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Imperial Fall Structure Recipes:</strong> Unlock blueprints for exclusive architectural designs</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Construction Bench:</strong> Imperial Fall Crafting Bench</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>New Consumable:</strong> Endurance Pill</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>3 Rare Smelting Materials:</strong> Aqua Jade Ingot, Boiling Silver Ingot, Immortal Molt Ingot</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After the Xizhou Civilization Pack version is launched, open &quot;Silk Road Atlas&quot; to track quest objectives, dungeon locations, and boss coordinates. Completing tasks will unlock related recipes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Additionally, this update introduces a range of <strong>new gameplay mechanics</strong> available to all players, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Profession Change System</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Crop Expertise</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Martial Scripture Scrolls</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Horse Grooming</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Autonomous Warrior Hiring</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Zip-line Construction</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare to embark on an <strong>epic new chapter of exploration, conquest, and innovation</strong>!</p>","developers":["Angela Game"],"fullgame":{"appid":"1371580","name":"Myth of Empires"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.ste